<h2>Our Verdict</h2>
<p>The best portable elliptical under desk is the one light enough that you never think twice about picking it up. For most people that is the [[amazon:cubii-move]]: one-hand carry, quiet and cordless. If you want the smallest footprint for trips and tiny desks, choose the [[amazon:cubii-go]]. Add a mat for each room and you have a machine that follows you through the whole day.</p>
